{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55464","headline":"赠孟宾于（题拟） · 赵晟","name":"赠孟宾于（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上国登科建业游，鼎分踪迹便淹留。\n江干旅梦三千里，海内诗名四十秋。\n华表柱边人不识，烂柯山下水空流。\n自从叔宝朝天後，赢得安闲养白头。\n（周本淳校点本《诗话总龟》卷二八引《雅言系述》。\n）（按：此诗当作于南唐授士之次年，援旧例仍收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵晟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}